  "reviews": [
    {
      "author": "r96sk",
      "content": "<em>'You’re Cordially Invited'</em>: bad movie! It's as unfunny as it is unlikeable, there isn't one character that I wanted to see appear in front of my eyes; and they attempt to redeem them all at the end, which falls flat. Also, Will Ferrell and Reese Witherspoon aren't the best match.\r\n\r\nThe end credit singalong with Ferrell and Witherspoon is the only part of this that I'd list under (mini) positives. There are a couple of decent bits scattered in, though none of which stick in the memory as they are paired with rubbish. The near two hour run time doesn't helped either.",
      "rating": 5,
      "createdAt": "2025-02-10T00:54:41Z"
    }
  ],
